OL,3,ASchools, libraries and parents face
OL,4,Adilemma over David Walliams books
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome schools have removed David
OL,7,FWalliams books from their libraries
OL,8,Ffollowing the publication of
OL,9,Fallegations against the best-selling
OL,10,Fchildren's author and comedian.
OL,12,F"Head teachers are already making
OL,13,Fdifficult decisions about whether or
OL,14,Fnot these books should remain on the
OL,15,Fbookshelves of libraries at the
OL,16,Fmoment," said Pepe Di'Iasio, general
OL,17,Fsecretary of the Association of School
OL,18,Fand College Leaders.
OL,20,F"I'm aware from several of our members
OL,21,Fthat they've already taken the decision
OL,22,Fto take them off their shelves."
